        {
          "key": "c",
          "text": "A unit can be active while disabled",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "d",
          "text": "`active` and `enabled` always mean the same thing",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Current runtime state and startup configuration are different properties; the lab explicitly emphasizes `active ≠ enabled`.",
      "source": {
